window.products.push({"id":346050,"name":"Continental Bedding - Affinity Down Alternative Bed Pillow - 300 Thread Count 100% Soft Cotton Super Standard Queen Size 20x28 Pillow Pack of 1 Best P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e8kdxx2LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: This Downlike pillow is made with only the finest raw materials. This pillow will give you a feeling of luxury and comfort. It is made of 300 thread count fabric with a soft microfiber polyester filling, which feels like goose down. Durable and long-lasting so you can enjoy this item for many years! COMFORTABLE QUEEN SIZE 20X28 PILLOW: Each super standard queen size pack of one pillow filled with 30oz, sealed using traditional single needle stitch with self piping. The package includes either 1 pillow or 2 pillows. With our perfect combination of natural and luxurious polyester fillings, you'll never sleep more comfortably than when lying on one of these soft pillows. They're designed to support your neck while keeping you warm all night. 100% SOFT COTTON-COVERED PILLOW: Our pillow's polyester fibers are encased in an ultra-durable yet breathable 300 TC cotton pillowcase. Made of 100% natural soft cotton, these soft fabric covered cotton pillows allow you to throw them in the washing machine for a quick and easy freshening process that makes them feel like new. 100% POLYESTER MICROFIBER: This 100% polyester microfiber shell has a silky texture and smooth exterior, which makes you feel warm. It features piping along the edges for an elegant tailored look. BEAUTIFULLY PACKAGED: We are dedicated to providing you with a product that is both beautifully and intelligently packaged for your safety. Our Affinity Downlike pillows queen size set of 1 or 2 arrives in an environmentally friendly reusable storage pouch which helps keep it safe from harm during shipping. If you're looking for somewhere to store the pillow when not in use, this bag will do just fine!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e8kdxx2LL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Continental Bedding","source_asin":"B075KVKSWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075KVKSWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075KVKSWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":346051,"name":"Ancyk Dish Drying Mat for Kitchen Counter 2 Pack, Absorbent Microfiber Dishes Drainer Mats, Large Size 15×20 Inch, Drying Pad for Kitchen Countertop, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JSHqkYPDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Microfiber Dish Drying Mats】: The dish drying pad is made of 3 layers of microfiber, sponge and polyester fiber. Dish drying mat in water which can easily absorb and lock liquid and water. The XL dish drying mat is great for kitchen counter and bathroom countertop use. 【Protect Tableware】: This extra-large absorbent dish mat is designed to be larger than a regular drainer mat and can hold big pots, pans and more dishes. Buffer design prevents scratch from the dish, pan and countertop. Which is enough thickness can perfectly protect your countertop from wear. Also, the drying mat is soft and super absorbent water then dries quickly. 【Multifunctional Dishes Drainer Mats】: This Kitchen drying mat and its innovative honeycomb microfiber structure enhances absorption and quickens drying time. It can be placed anywhere you want to absorb water, such as kitchen countertops, shelves, under the sink, bathroom countertops, dining room tables, also it is great for pets as a dining mat or sleeping mat. 【Easy to Clean and Store】: A bag of dry mat for dishes with two countertops. Either surface use to absorb the water and keep it dry. The drying mat for kitchen counter can be hung or rolled up and toss in a drawer for storage without taking up extra space. 【Package Includes】: You will get 2 grey microfiber dish drying mats. These dish drainer mats are easy to clean. Simply wash with cold water or machine washable. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me. Ancyk team will provide the best customer service to every buyer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JSHqkYPDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancyk","source_asin":"B0B79QR1MH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346051","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B79QR1MH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B79QR1MH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
