window.products.push({"id":346054,"name":"Trudeau Gem 7-Inch Pepper Mill and Salt Mill, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QKNonrmiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Gem Pepper and Salt Mills you'll be able to have fresh ground pepper and salt when and where you need them. The mills stand 7-inch tall and have a contemporary and stylish look and feel. The pepper mill has a high quality carbon steel grinder that will stay sharp and the salt mill has a ceramic grinder that will never rust. Cut then grind design, provides maximum flavor. Mills can be used with any dry spice, including sea salt. Mills come filled and ready to use. Clear acrylic construction. Lifetime warrantee. By Trudeau a company that develops visionary products. Add an exciting flavor to your day, with Trudeau. Style eloquence, innovation Trudeau letting you savor life's little moments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QKNonrmiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trudeau","source_asin":"B0026RH724","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0026RH724","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0026RH724","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
