window.products.push({"id":346100,"name":"Nuovoware Oven Mitts, Premium Heat Resistant Kitchen Gloves Cotton & Polyester Quilted Oversized Mittens, 1 Pair, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VZVx62otL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER HIGH PERFORMANCE: Extra long heat resistant gloves provide maximum protection for your hands and forearms when cooking, insulating hands from extreme temperatures; heat-resistant up to 500 ℉(260 ℃). USER-FRIENDLY: Heavy duty soft polyester & cotton fabric layered oven mitts allows you to wear them comfortably and easy to maneuver, suit for all size hands. Oversized sleeve covers most of the forearms, provide protection for your forearms as well. NON-SLIP DESIGN: Flexible and comfortable grip for cooking, baking and grilling without slipping, keep you safe when handling hot items. EASY TO WASH AND STORE: Simply wash with warm soapy water, drip dry, and put away or hang them up using the attached loop. Machine Washable. CONVENIENCE: These oven mitts fit on either hand and are easy to get on or off. 1-Year Warranty. Nuovoware Oven Mitts: Nuovoware Oven Mitts are designed to withstand the heat when cooking, baking or Grilling. They are made with high-quality thick cotton and polyester, offering you superior protection and comfort, perfect for all cooking uses, including barbecues and ovens. Heat-resistant up to 500 ℉(260 ℃)! Product Description: * Super high performance heat gloves provide maximum protection for your hands in daily cooking; Heat resistant up to 500 ℉(260 ℃). * 12 inch long oversize sleeve covers most of the forearms, provide extra protection for your forearms. * Heavy duty cotton and polyester for heat resistance. * Non-slip silicone gripping prevents accidents and maintains safety. * Offer excellent gripping and superb flex, easy to maneuver around the kitchen. * Easy to wash and store, simply wash with warm soapy water, drip dry, and put away or hang them up using the attached loop. Machine Washable. 1-Year Warranty. Specification Materials: Polyester & Cotton Item Weight: 5.09 ounces Note for use: ▶ Do not use sharp tools to stab or cut the oven gloves. ▶ Never use it under circumstances with temperature over 500 ℉ / 260 ℃. ▶ Do not touch the heater of ovens with this oven mitts. UPC:782301281288","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VZVx62otL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuovoware","source_asin":"B071CVLXXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071CVLXXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071CVLXXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
