window.products.push({"id":346280,"name":"4PCS Pretty Long Eyelash Shower Curtain Sets Gold Drips Hello Gorgeous Waterproof Cloth Polyester Bath Curtain Bathtub Curtains, Bathroom Carpet Toile","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wbye27aLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【PACKAGE INCLUDED】: The 4 pcs shower curtain set contains the follwing items: Hello Gorgeous Eyelashes pattern Shower Curtain x 1 PCS + Bath Mat x 1 PCS + Toilet Lid Cover x 1 PCS + U-Type Rug x 1 PCS + 12 PCS/C-shaped free Shower Curtain Hooks. Ideal dimension of the eyelash shower curtain (70.8×70.8\") suits for most people's needs.Easily fits any standard size shower / tub and works with straight or curved shower rods. No liner is needed. ✔【WATERPROOF CLOTH 】The girly Rose Gold Eyelash Shower Curtain is made of high quality polyester, which is waterproof, durable and dry quickly. This shower curtain is environmental friendly; RUGS: The bath mat/U-type rug are made of high quality and soft flannel, sponge and non-slip bottom, which is anti-slip, durable, easy to clean, safe and skin friendly. The silky touch gives you the ultimate comfort experience Easy to clean and dry fast. ✔【UNIQUE DESIGN】:　The eyelash bathroom shower curtain use high-definition graphic design and printed with advanced non-fading technology. This design will add life to the bathroom and make your bath time more enjoyable. It's also an ideal gift for holiday, valentine's day, Christmas, birthday to your family, friends, and coworkers, etc.; This cute eyelash-themed bathroom set will add life not only to your bathroom, but also to your life. ✔【EASY CARE AND PRODUCT SERVICE】: The Hello Gorgeous shower curtain is machine washable; Washing in cold water with mild detergent and hang to dry. Don't bleach or tumble dry. And Flannel bathroom mat/U-type rug can only be air-dried. ✔【Tips 】 To ensure product transport quality, we use high-quality vacuum packaging technology, so the bath curtain set is thinner than the picture, slightly wrinkled, please open the packaging product after receiving the goods for 12 hours or with little water Soak, the thickness after drying will restore the original. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us.We will reply and solve your problem 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wbye27aLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANSHUOY","source_asin":"B0C2XXTJWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2XXTJWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2XXTJWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":346281,"name":"Cork Coasters Round for Drinks, 6 PCS, 4\"×4\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JWOA467eL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Cork Coasters Round for Drinks, Absorbent Each one of those Beverage Coasters is hand finished for smooth edges and designed with a hand-crafted package to ensure a memorable gifting experience. So what coaster material is the best option? You can come across silicone coasters, bamboo coasters, felt coasters, slate coasters and many others. But an experienced buyer knows that cork coasters make their job for 100%. Natural cork protects furniture, tables, desks or any other gentle surface against stains, scratches and watermarks. Size: Thickness 1/5 inch(5mm), diameter 4 inch(10mm package：6 pieces","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JWOA467eL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Helper","source_asin":"B07HNYNDJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HNYNDJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HNYNDJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":346282,"name":"Lily of the Valley Spa by Danhui Nai Blue Bathroom Bath Spa Wall Art Print Framed Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XV1m-blNL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1) Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), cheaper less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2) After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 15) Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XV1m-blNL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Framed Art by Tilliams","source_asin":"B006EPT2R2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006EPT2R2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006EPT2R2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
