window.products.push({"id":346330,"name":"Table Pad - Traditional Custom Table Pads (Includes 2 Leaves)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5175-k7AJoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HEAVY DUTY and hand-upholstered. We designed our table pads for traditional use. You take it out when you want to use it and put it away when you're done. We even go so far as to put magnets behind the upholstery work. That way, when you bump your pads together, it locks. Here at Table Pads Now we take special pride in making sure your table pad is exactly what you need and deserve as our customer. WHY TABLE PADS? We hand craft custom table pads that match your existing décor. We believe everyone deserves a table pad that will compliment and protect their beautiful table. Whether your family sits down for dinner every night or gathers for the holidays, you should feel the comfort of knowing your table is fully protected! MAGNETIC LOCK SYSTEM. Wow! Did we think this one out! What we do is place magnets and bars behind your upholstery, and when you bump the pads together, they lock! Pretty simple right? Since they are completely covered, there is no way the magnetic locks could EVER harm or scratch your table. (Our job is to protect your table, not hurt it!) This was such novel system, a patent was issued to protect our good idea. We call them MagnaLoc...and they are AMAZING. PROTECTION. There are more ways to hurt your table than could ever be listed in a simple description. Here's what we did: we've designed the table pads to make sure that nothing we could think of could hurt your table. Our table pads protect from heat. (We have tested them at 550 degrees. The pads were ruined, but the table didn't even get a smudge.) They'll protect your table from kids, sunlight, and bad choices, ensuring your table will last a lifetime. ORDERING with Amazon. Amazon sure makes this easy! We both get a trusted platform, and we get the world’s best customers. We've been making custom table pads in downtown Indianapolis for more than thirty years. Most of our business comes from happy customers like you, so when you're completely happy, tell all your friends. If we do make an error or mistake, tell us, and we'll make it right. THEN tell all your friends. We'll send simple instructions in a message if your table is uniquely shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5175-k7AJoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Table Pads Now","source_asin":"B07WWBSYJ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WWBSYJ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WWBSYJ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":346331,"name":"5.5 Oz Foil Cupcake Cups Muffin Tins 50 Pack,LNYZQUS Cupcake Liners With Dome Lids,Disposable Ramekins Pans Tins Cupcake Wrappers Holders,Large Muffin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DQaTZATaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【No Cupcake Pan Needed】-These muffin cups are made of thick food-grade foil paper,sturdy and grease-proof,can stand in the oven without muffin pan.The muffin tins are oven ,microwaves and air fryer safe, and can withstand temperatures up to 250℃/482℉.(Tips:the foil cupcake liners cannot be used directly on fire!) 【Pack of 50 Sets】 - Including 50pcs foil cupcake liners with 50 matching transparent dome lids,free 50 individually wrapped spoons.Sturdy cupcake cups with lids, facilitate you to carry cupcakes muffin out with no need of cupcake holders. 【Easy to Use】 - Using this disposable ramekins with lids,no need to waste time cleaning the baking pans.The cupcake does not need to be demolded.Make frosting on the cupcake and cover the lids,put it in the refrigerator for freshness, no need of cupcake containers. With the disposable fork spoons, it made it easy for people to self serve from the banquet table. 【Large Capacity】 - The metallic baking cups can hold about 5.5 oz food capacity. Ideal disposable mini pans for cupcake,muffin,mini pie, mini cake,souffle,custard ,mini cheesecake,snack,tart and much more. 【Tips about the Dome Lids】 - The lids are tightly attached with two, please separate them when using.And the clear lids are not heat resistant!Please allow cups to cool prior to applying lids. 【Wide Usage 】- These cupcake wrappers with dome lids and spoons are great for home and outdoor usage such as birthday party, wedding,baby shower,thanksgiving,Christmas and Halloween,etc.holiday celebration,And picnic, camping and other leisure activities. Also ideal for restaurants, bakery, chef,and other catering venues. 【Sincerely at Your Service】 - Please feel free to contact us if you have any problems about the jumbo cupcake liners. We offer a 60 days refund service to help you get a great shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DQaTZATaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LNYZQUS","source_asin":"B09QG8495V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QG8495V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QG8495V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
