window.products.push({"id":346334,"name":"Wemore 2 in 1 Weighted Heated Blanket for Adults, Sherpa Fleece Heated Weighted Blankets 15lbs, Electric Blanket Twin Size 48x72 Inches, with 10 Heati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oi0Bp0qBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2-in-1 Weighted Heated Blanket: Wemore 2-in-1 heated weighted blanket is weighted and heated to offer soothing and warm sensations. Ultra-soft flannel and Sherpa fleece is super snugly for lounging and resting, easing you off to fast & refreshing snooze. Uniform weight distribution: The 15 pound weighted electric blanket contains high-quality micro-glass beads that evenly distribute pressure, reducing tossing and turning during sleep, allowing you to feel comfortable and peaceful. 10 Heating Levels & 10 Hour Auto-off Timer: The weighted heated blankets full size are intelligently designed with 10 heating levels (86-122°F) and 1h - 10h auto off timers. It will power off automatically when the timer is up just to be safe. Elevated Safety: In the case the heating is set to higher than level 4 and timer to longer than 3 hrs, safety features will be activated as the heating bumped down to level 4 in 3 hours, maximally ensure safety, coziness, and energy-efficiency. Blanket Care & After-sales Service: Spot clean, do not bleach / iron / dry clean. Please read the user guide before using. Please contact us in case there is any issue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Oi0Bp0qBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wemore","source_asin":"B09Q8LB3RF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q8LB3RF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q8LB3RF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":346335,"name":"HUSUE 5000mAh Replacement Battery for Dyson V10 Battery, Compatible with Dyson V10 Absolute V10 Animal V10 Motorhead V10 Fluffy SV12 Vacuum Cleaners, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I85anrZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High quality and larger capacity replacement battery for Dyson V10 battery: Battery type: Rechargeable Li-ion | Voltage: 25.2V | Capacity: 5.0Ah/5000mAh | Certified: CE, FCC, PSE, RoHS | No memory effect: can be charged or discharged as needed at any time. The whole protective case is made of high quality ABS material with excellent durability; the inside lithium-ion battery cells and chip is of safe and stable performance. Higher capacity of 5000mAh than others, providing longer working time, ideal for replacing the old one to clean your house. Completely compatible with Dyson V10 vacuum cleaners: Our battery is a good replacement for Dyson V10 battery with a higher capacity, it is compatible with all Dyson V10 vacuum cleaners, such as V10 Animal, V10 Animal Pro, V10 Absolute, V10 Fluffy, V10 Motorhead, V10 Total Clean, SV12. (ONLY Fit for V10, NOT fit for V6, V7, V8, SV10). Stable and safe for use: Our battery replacement for Dyson V10 battery is made with high quality battery cells and protection chip, providing multiple protections with short-circuit protection, over-heating protection, over-charge protection and over-voltage protection. With such protections, it's safe for charging and using with stable performance and longer working life. Easy to install: It's very easy to install and remove our battery from your vacuum cleaner. Firstly remove the screws which connects the battery and the vacuum cleaner, then plug our replacement battery into the vacuum cleaner, and then put back the screws, then you can start to use it. After using, please store the battery in a clean, dry, cool place away from heat and metal objects. Don't charge the battery immediately after it runs out of power, let the battery cool down 10-20 minutes before recharging. Replacement battery for Dyson V10 battery with indicator light: During charging, steady blue means charging; light off means charging completed; flashing yellow means inside protection system works, stop charging it, wait for some minutes to charge again. During use: steady blue means working; flashing blue means need recharging; flashing yellow means inside protection system works, stop using it, wait for some minutes to use again. flashing red means error occurred, contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I85anrZFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUSUE","source_asin":"B0BP6DVWTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP6DVWTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP6DVWTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
