window.products.push({"id":346462,"name":"Valentine’s Day Wood Bead Garland with Tassels and XOXO Wooden Embellishments Rustic Farmhouse Tiered Tray Wedding Decorations Home Decor (Red & White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719fTORKnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Valentine's Day Wood Bead Garland】: Our farmhouse inspired Valentine's Day wood bead is done in beautiful muted tones of berry red, pink, natural wood and white, Interspersed with the jute & red buffalo plaid tassels and XOXO embellishments. Will highlight the Valentine's Day and make you feel the strong Valentine's Day atmosphere. 【Natural & Premium Quality】: This rustic farmhouse inspired love bead garland is made of natural wood beads and premium jute. The beads measure 18mm so they are large and have a nice heft to them without any burrs or wood chips. XOXO wood sign is chic and sturdy. All the great natural & love elements can add texture and sweetness to your home. 【Various Decorations】:This Valentine's Day wooden beaded garland measures 33\" in length from wood sign end to tassel end. Tassel measures 4\". Also perfect to add romantic feeling to any Rae Dunn canisters, tier tray, wrapping candles, vases, mason jars, mantels, book! Also perfect gift for Valentine's Day, birthday party, New Year, Galentine’s day etc. 【Handmade With Love】: Just like all our garlands, the wood beads are hand-painted, tassels are crafted by hand and strung together to create a beautiful garland. The color is bright and beautiful. Each garland is lovingly crafted in hopes that you will love adorning and accenting your home during the Valentine's Day with them as much as we do. 【100% Satisfied Service】: We are a company dedicated to providing better products and services to our customers, so if you have any dissatisfaction with our Valentine’s Day Wood Bead Garland, please feel free to contact us and we will give you a satisfactory reply within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719fTORKnrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OWOYDOJ","source_asin":"B09BHRTYBH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BHRTYBH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BHRTYBH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
