window.products.push({"id":346493,"name":"Cen-Tec Systems 94225 Shop Vacuum 20 Ft Whip Hose and Power Tool Adapter Set for Dust Collection, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VaYHDmEJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The 94225 is designed to provide the owner of a home shop vacuum the benefit of a 1. 25” X 20 foot premium commercial grade hose for general use of the vacuum and at the same time allow for the vacuums use for dust recovery when connected to most major brands of power tools inclusive of a dust recovery port or tool shroud. A second 1” X 10 foot lightweight highly flexible hose can be added to connect to smaller power tools. The 1” hose has lighter weight and added flexibility, which permits the use and manipulation of smaller tools like palm sanders without the hose interfering with or restricting movement. Consider using an overhead hook to hang the larger 1. 25” hose with the 1” hose draping from above onto the working surface. The 94225 includes two soft TPE adaptors that can press fit to either the 1. 25” or if working with the 1” hose then the 1” hose and engage with industry typical dust ports on tools or dust shrouds. The 1” adaptor fits over and hold firmly to tools or shrouds with a 1” male outer diameter. There are some shrouds and tools designed for a female connection and the same adaptors 1. 39 lead edge to 1. 44” expanded diameter is designed for a firm hold in most common dust ports of this design. A second 1. 50” soft TPE inner diameter fitting will again fit to either hose section and onto power tools with 1. 50” outer diameter dust ports like those found on most miter saws. This same fitting would accept the third adaptor for connecting to work stations with 2. 25” connection ports. The adaptors provided with the 94225 permit connections to most major brands of power tools and related shrouds including Skil Bosch. Porter Cable, DeWalt, Festool, Hitachi, Kobalt, Makita, and Craftsman as well as many brands of work station in support of these tools. The tank end is designed to fit most major brands of home shop vacuums including Shop Vac, Craftsman, Ridgid, Vacmaster, DeWalt, Festool, Dustless, and Fein.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VaYHDmEJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cen-Tec Systems","source_asin":"B081HWW7KM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081HWW7KM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081HWW7KM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":346494,"name":"Elegant Comfort #1 Rated Bed Sheet Set on Amazon - Silky Soft - 1500 Thread Count Egyptian Quality Luxurious Wrinkle, Fade, Stain Resistant 6-Piece St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GOU7vCUML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience luxury like you've never felt before. Sheets that feel almost hedonistic, this sumptuous set is going to bring your dreams to a whole new level. Slip between the covers and let yourself wallow in the decadence that this bedding offers. Add in delightfully soft, ultra-plush pillowcases, and you'll truly feel pampered. This 4-piece set is crafted from incredible, wrinkle-free 100 GSM microfiber and features an elegant dobby stripe pattern. It's available in a variety of beautiful colors, and no matter which one you choose, when morning comes and the alarm clock goes off, you just might be tempted to crawl farther beneath these covers and try to pick up where your dreams left off. Care Instructions: Machine wash Cold, Gentle Cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. Iron as needed- Elegant Comfort","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GOU7vCUML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Comfort","source_asin":"B019JDWWB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019JDWWB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019JDWWB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false})