window.products.push({"id":346783,"name":"Aibenta Mini Bag Sealer, Handheld Heat Vacuum Sealers, Bag Sealer Heat Seal, 2 in 1 Heat Sealer and Cutter Handheld Portable Bag Resealer Sealer for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YvYmVEq6L._AC_SL1154_.jpg","description":"The Handheld Bag Sealer is Quick and Easy Way to Heat Seal Chip Bags and Keep your Snacks Fresh 【SEALING STEPS 】 ① After the battery is installed, it will not automatically heat up, and it will only heat up when pressed. ② Install the battery according to the positive and negative instructions at the bottom of the battery slot of the product.  If the battery is installed upside down, the sealing machine will not heat up. ③ After the battery is installed, keep pressing for about 3 - 5 seconds to start heating. ④ Put the bag to be sealed in the middle, thinner bags can be torn quickly, and thicker ones need to be drawn slowly at a uniform speed. ⑤ After use, there is no need to remove the battery, put the hook is stuck at the sealing part. 【CUTTING STEPS 】 ① Hold the plastic bag in one hand (2-3cm reserved) and hold the knife in the plastic bag in the other hand to continue cutting. ② Turn the plastic bag over and cut the remaining bag by step①. 【SPECIFICATION】 Color: White  Material: Ssfety ABS material, resistance to high and low temperature Size: 3.9 * 1.4 * 1.4in Weight: 60g 【NOTE】 ① Do not press violently when sealing, otherwise it will cause the metal contact piece to deform and not heat up. ② The bag to be sealed must be kept clean and free of water, oil and other stains. ③ Please remove the battery if it is not used for a long time.④ Suitable for most plastic bags (PE, PP, PVC...)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YvYmVEq6L._AC_SL1154_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aibenta","source_asin":"B0897P9FZ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0897P9FZ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0897P9FZ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
