window.products.push({"id":346809,"name":"Set of 2 - TrueCraftware Stainless Steel - Dual Sided - Tall Fold - Table Top - Napkin Dispenser with Polished Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Elwjd7RLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This gorgeous mirror-polished, stainless steel napkin dispenser will catch the eyes of your guests or clients as they reach for a napkin from the dual-side dispensing napkin holder. The spring loaded mechanism allows for easy napkin release, and the holder fits a tall standard napkin size. The dispenser has 4 unnoticeable rubber feet on the bottom so that the dispenser will stay in place, and not slide around or tip over. The napkin holder measures 4.5\" x 3.75\" x 7\"This napkin dispenser is perfect for a table or counter at home, or strategically placed on each dining table at a restaurant. This holder is constructed out of sturdy stainless steel and is easy to load.  Great for restaurants, BBQs, banquets, and events, these stainless steel napkin dispensers are a life saver for those tasty meals you'll be serving up. Anyone in the restaurant business has seen this scenario played out a thousand times: A glass is knocked over and soda spills across a table loaded with patrons. People stand up to avoid the dripping mess, and it takes several trips, and minutes, to grab more napkins and eventually restore order. A dining experience has been ruined for one table-full of customers, and the patrons around them have had their meal interrupted, at best. While such accidents can't be avoided, they could be fairly easily managed with the help of this stainless steel napkin dispenser. This dispenser is designed to hold Maximum Dimensions: 3 5/8\"W x 6 7/8\"L folded napkins and is perfect for tabletops. SET OF 2 NAPKIN DISPENSERS!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Elwjd7RLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TrueCraftware","source_asin":"B00WTE3B1A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WTE3B1A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WTE3B1A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
