window.products.push({"id":346963,"name":"Dallas Watercolor Map by Naxart, 24 by 32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915Rr8u7JRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This gallery-wrapped art piece features a watercolor map of Dallas, Texas. We are a group of creative professionals with diverse backgrounds in architecture, interior design, art, automotive design, and photography. All of us are passionate about their fields of expertise as well as art and design in general. Instead of a traditional approach of associating art with a specific artist we chose to create a NaxArt brand that represents our values and vision rather than promoting individual agendas. We also work with architects and interior designers looking for unique art work for projects ranging from a small NYC studio design to large scale corporate development projects. We also love our customers that simply discover NaxArt's collection of art and acquire our art to design their own homes. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/915Rr8u7JRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00GSO1FO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GSO1FO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GSO1FO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
