window.products.push({"id":346992,"name":"Simply Genius Mesh Food Cover Set, 2 Jumbo (47”x26”) & 4 Large (17”x17”) Pop-Up Food Tents/Food Covers For Outdoors, Reusable and Collapsible, Food Ne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S8Q9OSjoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food Tent Covers for Outdoor Serving: 4 Large pop up tents and 2 Jumbo size are ready for small gatherings and big parties. Large covers a plate up to 16 inches, great for appetizers, and bowls of chips and dip. Jumbo extra large food tent can cover up to six 16” plates, a whole buffet! Set up appetizers, a salad bar, taco bar, or big plates of ribs. Fits a dessert table with sheet cake. Jumbo: 47x26” x 20”H; Folded: 31x2” x 2”H; Large: 17x17” x 9”H; Folded: 17x2” x 2”H Outdoor Food Covers to Keep Bugs Away: Food tents/food covers for outdoors will keep flies and other uninvited guests away. Hungry dogs, sneaky cats, and curious kids won’t be able to poke around on the table, and eat food before it’s ready. The mesh screen bug net covering is durable, and the edges seal nicely to deflect blowing leaves and other debris. These food tents alleviate the difficulties of eating outside, so that you can enjoy dining outdoors! All Occasions: This set covers a variety of outdoor events. They’re ideal for a backyard BBQ cover, picnics and parties, or as catering supplies for big events. Great for birthday parties, weddings, graduations, reunions, and other celebrations. These collapsible pop up tent food covers are lightweight and can be carried right along with your picnic basket or easily tucked away in your RV Camper! Add them to your camping supplies, picnic accessories, grilling accessories or outdoor kitchen! Easy, Compact Design: Pull the top and the metal frame expands like an umbrella. The white mesh fabric is see-through, so food can be seen. The lace border adds protection, as well as elegance. Even the jumbo size is lightweight and easy to lift. They collapse quickly into a portable size. Unlike foil and plastic wrap, these are eco-friendly and reusable. Rinse with water to clean, and air dry. The storage sleeve with drawstring tie and toggle keeps them neat and travel ready. Versatile Uses: Restaurants, bars, churches and organizations can use these food tents for al fresco serving. They are also useful indoors to keep pets away from meal prep, family and holiday meals, and cooling baked goods. From food tent to plant tent, they can be a pop open plant protectors from animals. As an alternative to plant netting in the garden, they can be a plant protector, or row covers for vegetables.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S8Q9OSjoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Genius","source_asin":"B0BBLSCNTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-346992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBLSCNTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBLSCNTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
